herolte: the governor v2 compared mach ticks with nanoseconds (0469)

min102 (E-0323): the summary line every 10 s never appeared and the minimum time between down steps was about 2.5 s instead of 60 ms, because last_log and hold_until are in mach_absolute_time ticks and were compared with nanosecond values. The two intervals are now converted with nanoseconds_to_absolutetime. herogov=2 only.

